","title":"修改冒險度檢查方式 ..","id":220,]),(["poster":"Elsa","time":803250266,"title":"About explore ....","body":"	Find a little bug in do_explore() of /std/guild.c

	printf(\"區域 : \"+set_color(\"%13s\", \"HIG\")+\"    探險度 : \"+
                        set_color(\"%2d.%2-d%%\", \"HIY\")+\"  升級標準 : %3d%%\\n\",
                        to_chinese(AREAS[i]), expl/100, expl%100,need_exp);

	若 expl%100 = 5 .. 將印出 xx.5 % (實際值應為 xx.05%) .. that's all


	PS:另外我寫了一份 top list of player explored points in /u/e/elsa/std
   覺得用得到的話再看看吧。(Any problem or suggestion please mail to me,thx)

							Sincerely, Elsa 6/16
